{"results":[{"url":"https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/ajmera-boulevard","title":"Ajmera Boulevard Malad West | 1 & 2 BHK at Mumbai - Digipaces","raw_content":"# Ajmera Boulevard Malad West, Mumbai\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Overview\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Project Name | Ajmera Boulevard | Location | Malad West, Mumbai |\n| Developer | Ajmera Group | Possessions | December 31, 2025 |\n| Project Sub Type | Apartment | Project Type | Residential |\n| Storey | G + 22 Storey | Towers/Wings | 1 |\n| Land Parcel | N/A | Rera No. | P51800054569 |\n| Per/sqft Onwards | N/A | No. of Units | N/A |\n| Carpet Area | 485 – 690 Sqft | Typology | 1 BHK, 2 BHK |\n| Total Area | N/A | Security | N/A |\n\nPrice: ₹1.42 Cr\\* - 2.02 Cr\\*\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Key Features\n\n* Luxurious 1 & 2 BHK homes in Malad West, Mumbai\n* Part of prestigious Dhruv Park gated community\n* 22-floor elevation with 2 wings of opulence\n* A legacy of luxurious living for generations\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Master Plan\n\n[![01KHDHEJ3F13Q5RWWH9DNB2ADJ](https://digipaces.com/storage/01KHDHEJ3F13Q5RWWH9DNB2ADJ.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/01KHDHEJ3F13Q5RWWH9DNB2ADJ.jpg)\n\n[![01KHDHEJ3HSP6Q870P161MZV8K](https://digipaces.com/storage/01KHDHEJ3HSP6Q870P161MZV8K.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/01KHDHEJ3HSP6Q870P161MZV8K.jpg)\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Gallery\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-About-Us](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-About-Us.jpg)\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Clubhouse-Terrace-turf](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Clubhouse-Terrace-turf.jpg)\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-Banner-1](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Banner-1.jpg)\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-Banner-2](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Banner-2.jpg)\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Gymnasium](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Gymnasium.jpg)\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Kids-Play-Area](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Kids-Play-Area.jpg)\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Multi-Purpose-Hall](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Multi-Purpose-Hall.jpg)\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Open-Space-in-Landscape-Terrace-Garden](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Open-Space-in-Landscape-Terrace-Garden.jpg)\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Swimming-Pool](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Amenities-Swimming-Pool.jpg)\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-Gallery-Bedroom](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Gallery-Bedroom.jpg)\n\n![Ajmera-Boulevard-Gallery-Livenig-Room](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Gallery-Livenig-Room.jpg)\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard About\n\nAjmera Boulevard Malad West is an under-construction project by the well-known developer Ajmera Cityscapes, located opposite Silver Oaks Banquets, Malad, Kanchpada, Mumbai, and offers 1 & 2 BHK residences. Ajmera Boulevard Malad West features an exclusive tower of G+22 storeys.\n\nAjmera Boulevard Malad West is OC Received and Ready To Move. Ajmera Boulevard by Ajmera Cityscapes MahaRERA is P51800054569.\n\nAjmera Boulevard Malad West includes over 20 modern amenities such as a, Swimming Pool, Club House, Library, Multipurpose  Hall, Equipped Gymnasium, Terrace Garden, Yoga Studio, A Lush Rooftop Turf, Kids Play Area, Rooftop Fitness Area, Cricket Pitch, Jogging Track, Robotic car parking. The internal features of Ajmera Boulevard Mumbai include anti-skid tiles, luxurious vitrified tiles, exquisite branded CP fittings, exhaust fan provisions, and granite kitchen platforms.\n\n1 BHK apartments at Ajmera Boulevard start at ₹1.42 Cr with a carpet area of 485 sqft. The construction is progressing in full swing. For additional information, including floor plans, price sheets, RERA ID, reviews, possession timelines, construction status, location advantages, and specifications, visit our sales office,  Address is - Ajmera Boulevard, Dhruv Park, opposite Silver Oaks Banquets, Malad, Kanchpada, Malad West, Malad, Mumbai, 400064.\n\nAjmera Boulevard Mumbai offers excellent Connectivity Ryan International School - 900 mtrs, Sun Multispeciality Hospital - 750 mtrs, Navjivan College - 2.3 km, Mumbai Intl Airport - 13.9 km, Malad Station - 1.8 km, Infiniti Mall - 1.2 km, Western Expressway - 2.4 km, Malad West -900 mtrs.\n\nAjmera Cityscapes has many ongoing, upcoming & completed Projects Ajmera Manor - Borivali West, Ashjit Ajmera Downtown - Marine Lines, HJ Ajmera Shrinagar - Vile Parle, Ajmera Heights - Kalyan West, Ajmera Midtown – Kalbadevi.\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Floor Plans\n\n[![1 BHK](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Floor-Plan-1 BHK-485 Sqft.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Floor-Plan-1 BHK-485 Sqft.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 1 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 485 Sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹14,200,000.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n[![2 BHK](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Floor-Plan-2 BHK-690 Sqft.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Ajmera-Boulevard-Floor-Plan-2 BHK-690 Sqft.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 2 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 690 Sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹20,203,200.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Price\n\n| Name | Carpet Area | Price | Furnishing Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | 485 Sqft sq. ft. | ₹1.42 Cr\\* | Unfurnished |\n| 2 BHK | 690 Sqft sq. ft. | ₹2.02 Cr\\* | Unfurnished |\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Amenities\n\njogging track\n\nClubhouse\n\nCricket pitch\n\nGymnasium\n\nKids Play Area\n\nLibrary\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\nRooftop restaurant\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nTerrace garden\n\nYoga studio and meditation area\n\nCovered Car Parking\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Features\n\nVitrified Tile Dado 2'0\" high above Kitchen platform\n\nVitrified Tiles for Bathroom Flooring & Dado\n\nVitrified Tiles for Living, Dining, Kitchen & Bedrooms\n\nWash Basin Counters\n\nKitchen platform with SS sink & Drain board\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Walkthrough Video\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Location\n\n  \n\n**Ajmera Boulevard Address (Sales Gallery/Office/Experience Center):**   \nAjmera Boulevard, Dhruv Park, opposite Silver Oaks Banquets, Malad, Kanchpada, Malad West, Malad, Mumbai, 400064.\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Location Advantages\n\nMumbai Intl Airport\n\n13.9 km\n\nMalad Station\n\n1.8 km\n\nInfiniti Mall\n\n1.2 km\n\nWestern Expressway\n\n2.4 km\n\nMalad West\n\n900 M\n\nRyan International School\n\n900 M\n\nNavjivan College\n\n2.3 M\n\nSun Multispeciality Hospital\n\n750 M\n\n## Developer\n\n![01JRZSAX8DA5MT4STAKE6GNHSX](https://digipaces.com/storage/developer-logos/01JRZSAX8DA5MT4STAKE6GNHSX.jpg)\n\nAjmera Group\n\nAjmera Group is a respected name in Indian real estate with 30+ years of experience, over 21 completed projects, and 3 million+ sq.ft. delivered. Founded in the 1950s by Shri Kishore Ajmera and later led by Shri Jasmin Ajmera, the group has delivered homes to 3,000+ happy families. Known for consistency, trust, and functional design, Ajmera Group focuses on creating \"Fuller Living\" – spaces that offer comfort, openness, bonding, and lasting memories. Their portfolio spans residential, commercial, hospitality, and international trade sectors.\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard FAQ's\n\nAjmera Boulevard offers 1 & 2 BHK homes ranging from Carpet 485 – 690 Sqft.\n\nThe project includes over 25 amenities such as a Swimming Pool, Club House, Library, Multipurpose  Hall, Equipped Gymnasium, Terrace Garden, Yoga Studio, A Lush Rooftop Turf, Kids Play Area, Rooftop Fitness Area, Cricket Pitch, Jogging Track, Robotic car parking and more.\n\nLocated Nearby Ryan International School - 900 mtrs, Sun Multispeciality Hospital - 750 mtrs, Navjivan College - 2.3 km, Mumbai Intl Airport - 13.9 km, Malad Station - 1.8 km, Infiniti Mall - 1.2 km, Western Expressway - 2.4 km, Malad West -900 mtrs, the property offers excellent connectivity.\n\nYes, Ajmera Boulevard is an RERA-authorized project with MahaRERA number P51800054569.\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard MAHARASHTRA RERA Details\n\nNo documents available.\n\n## Get In Touch\n\n## Latest Projects in Malad West\n\n[Chaitanya Ethics Orovia](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/chaitanya-ethics-orovia)   [Malad Vrindavan CHSL](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/malad-vrindavan-chsl)   [Aquarock Aquarose](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/aquarock-aquarose)   [H Rishabraj Ceramont](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/h-rishabraj-ceramont)   [Ruparel Stardom](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/ruparel-stardom)   [Anchor Point Aviara](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/anchor-point-aviara)   [Priyam Residency](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/priyam-residency)   [Stans Marve Royal](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/stans-marve-royal)   [Modis Rashmi Signature](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/modis-rashmi-signature)   [Raj Imperia](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/raj-imperia)   [Royal Bliss](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/royal-bliss)   [Narang Vivenda](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/narang-vivenda)   [Shreeji Tapovan](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/shreeji-tapovan)   [Arkade Eden](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/arkade-eden)\n\n## Latest Projects by Ajmera Group\n\n[Ajmera Downtown](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/kalbadevi/ajmera-downtown)\n\n## Share this Project:\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.nobroker.in/ajmera-boulevard-malad-west_mumbai-prjt-8a9f8c838ee16e08018ee176bf37021a","title":"Ajmera Boulevard Malad West: Price, Photos & Floor Plans","raw_content":"![Ajmera Boulevard](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fmedia%2Fbuilding%2F8a9f8c838ee16e08018ee176bf37021a%2Fimages%2F8a9f8c838ee16e08018ee176bf37021a_project_image_6LAtPZJIWh1713181340537_12556_iris_medium.jpg&w=3840&q=75)\n![back arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ArrowBackIOSWhite_rbReact_gtyg6.svg)\n![share](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fnob-common%2FShareNew_react_443425.webp&w=48&q=75)\n![leftIcon1](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/BigEllipse.svg)\n![leftIcon2](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/BigEllipse.svg)\n![rightIcon2](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/BigEllipse.svg)\n![rightIcon1](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/BigEllipse.svg)\n![Rera](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/reraProjectInfo.svg)\n\n# Ajmera Boulevard\n\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9f8c838ee16e08018ee176bf37021a/logo/8a9f8c838ee16e08018ee176bf37021a_logo_oVQSPEPuXN1721903413781.jpg)\n\n## By Ajmera Group\n\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/ArrowForwardBlack_nbReact_453525.svg)\n![house](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/houseProjectInfo.svg)\n![building](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/buildingProjectInfo.svg)\n![boxProject](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/boxProjectInfo.svg)\n![frame](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/frameProjectInfo.svg)\n![claim](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fnob-merchandise%2FclaimbenefitsIcon_nbReact221sor.webp&w=3840&q=75)\n![right](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rightArrowProjectInfo.svg)\n\n## Key Features\n\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Floor Plans\n\n## Amenities in Ajmera Boulevard\n\n![show more](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/greenDropDownIcn.svg)\n![show more](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/greenDropDownIcn.svg)\n\n## About the Ajmera Boulevard\n\n## **A Glimpse Into Ajmera Boulevard**\n\n**Located in Malad West in Mumbai, Ajmera Boulevard offers a luxury living experience spread across 1.50 lush acres. This thoughtfully crafted enclave provides a diverse selection of homes including 1, 2, and 2.5 BHK apartments, with options for jodi apartments. Comprising 2 elegantly designed buildings housing a total of 170 units, each space is tailored for comfort and style.**\n\n**Residents enjoy unparalleled connectivity with the Western Express Highway and Metro Line 7 just moments away, making the daily commute or weekend trips equally convenient.**\n\n## **When is Ajmera Boulevard's Possession Date?**\n\n**Ajmera Boulevard is scheduled to commence possession in December 2026.**\n\n## **Why Buy a Property at Ajmera Boulevard?**\n\n**Separate Parking Tower with Robotic Car Parking System**\n\n**Spacious and Airy Homes**\n\n## **Amenities of Ajmera Boulevard**\n\n**Fitness Corner: At Ajmera Boulevard, staying fit is a walk in the park, a jog on the track, or a workout in the gym. Lace up your sneakers for the jogging track or follow the reflexology pathway for a wellness walk. And if you're in the mood to get fit, the state-of-the-art gym awaits you.**\n\n**Make a Splash: Dive into the good life with the shimmering swimming pool at Ajmera Boulevard. It’s your oasis in the city where you can swim laps to the rhythm of the bustling city or just float and let the water's calm wash away the day’s stress.**\n\n**Rooftop Leisure: The clubhouse terrace turf at Ajmera Boulevard is a lofty escape where you can kick back and relax. Surrounded by landscaped terrace gardens, it's the perfect spot to host a soirée under the stars or simply enjoy a quiet evening with a view.**\n\n**Unwind with a Book: For the bookworms, the library at Ajmera Boulevard is a sanctuary of knowledge. It’s where stories and wisdom line the shelves, inviting you to lose yourself in a book or discover new worlds in the quiet comfort of this literary retreat.**\n\n## **Ajmera Boulevard: Price and Floor Plan**\n\n**At Ajmera Boulevard, prices start at Rs. 1.43 Crore.**\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Configuration | Carpet Area |\n| 1 BHK | 485 sq. ft. |\n| 2 BHK | 690 sq. ft. |\n| 2.5 BHK | 970 sq. ft. |\n\nConfiguration\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1 BHK\n\n485 sq. ft.\n\n2 BHK\n\n690 sq. ft.\n\n2.5 BHK\n\n970 sq. ft.\n\n## **How to Download Ajmera Boulevard Brochure in PDF?**\n\n**Click the \"View Brochure\" button on the right-hand side of the page.**\n\n**Input your mobile number and email to access the brochure.**\n\n**After entering the details, the brochure will open up for viewing.**\n\n**To save a copy, click the \"Download\" button to obtain the brochure in PDF format.**\n\n## **Ajmera Boulevard: Address and Location Advantages**\n\n**Ajmera Boulevard is located in Malad, Kanchpada, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064.**\n\n**Malad West is a vibrant and well-developed suburb located in the northern part of Mumbai. It's known for its lush greenery, primarily due to its location along Malad Creek and the surrounding mangrove areas. The locality is split from Malad East by the railway tracks of the Western Line of the Mumbai Suburban Railway, with Malad West being the more commercially active and residentially plush side.**\n\n**Your Health Partners, Just Around the Corner:**\n\n**In just a 4-minute drive, you can reach Sun Multispecialty Hospital, with Lifeline and Criticare Multispecialty Hospitals almost as close at 5 and 6 minutes, respectively.**\n\n**Vinayak Maternity and General Hospital is a mere 6-minute walk, even for your little ones or expecting mothers**\n\n**Entertainment and Leisure:**\n\n**At Ajmera Boulevard, it's a 5-minute drive from Infinity Mall’s retail therapy.**\n\n**If sports or fitness is your vibe, Goregaon Sports Club is just 7 minutes away.**\n\n**Movie night? PVR Cinemas rolls out the red carpet, 10 minutes from home.**\n\n**And for the shopaholic in you, Inorbit Mall stands a quick 10-minute drive away.**\n\n**Education at Your Doorstep:**\n\n**NK College is a quick 6-minute away and KES College isn't far behind at 9 minutes.**\n\n**Young minds at Pinnacle High International School and ORCHIDS The International School are just 9 and 11 minutes away from enlightening their days.**\n\n**Seamless Connectivity:**\n\n**The Malad Metro Station is a 5-minute ride down the road, while Malad Railway Station waits 10 minutes away for your daily commute.**\n\n**The Western Express Highway, your gateway to the city, is a quick 10-minute drive, and when wanderlust strikes, the International Airport is a 30-minute journey.**\n\n## **About Ajmera Group**\n\n**Ajmera Cityscapes, with a legacy stretching over three decades, is a hallmark of excellence in the real estate sector, headed by the vision of its late founding Chairman, Shri Kishore Ajmera. The company's philosophy is rooted in the pursuit of 'Fuller Living', a commitment to constructing spaces that are not just structures but embodiments of enriched lifestyles. The aim is to craft environments that resonate with abundance, vitality, and the warmth of connection, ensuring that each development is not merely a residence but a cradle for happy, memorable moments. To date, Ajmera Cityscapes has developed over 3 million square feet of area, fostered the joy of over 3,000 families, and is on the path of progress with more than 21 completed projects, alongside a substantial area currently under development.**\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard - RERA & Legal Certificates\n\n![view](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Eye.svg)\n\nThe Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 is Act of the Parliament of India...\n\n![copy](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Copy.svg)\n![copy](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Copy.svg)\n![approved](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rera_approved_seal.png)\n![Timely Dispute Resolution](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Question.svg)\n![Quality Assurance](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/SealCheck.svg)\n![Buyer Protection](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ShieldCheck.svg)\n![Transparency & Tracking](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/FileMagnifyingGlass.svg)\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard - Neighbourhood\n\n## Compare Projects\n\n## Price Trend for Ajmera Boulevard\n\n## Top Developers in Mumbai\n\n## Builders\n\nNo builders found\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### Where is Ajmera Boulevard located?\n\n### What is the available Apartment size in Ajmera Boulevard?\n\n### What is the RERA Number of Ajmera Boulevard of Malad West?\n\n### What is the price range of Ajmera Boulevard of Malad West?\n\n### Where to download the Ajmera Boulevard brochure?\n\n### Where to download the Ajmera Boulevard floor plan?\n\n### What is the nearest landmark to Ajmera Boulevard residential project?\n\n### What amenities are available at Ajmera Boulevard residential project?\n\n### Does Ajmera Boulevard residential project have covered car parking?\n\n### Which banks can approve loans for Ajmera Boulevard residential project?\n\n### Is a transportation facility easily available near Ajmera Boulevard residential project?\n\n![chat](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/Common/chatLightBg.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n\n## About the Builder\n\n![Ajmera Group Logo](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9f8c838ee16e08018ee176bf37021a/logo/8a9f8c838ee16e08018ee176bf37021a_logo_oVQSPEPuXN1721903413781.jpg)\n\n### Ajmera Group\n\nAt Ajmera, every project is about enriching people’s lives by creating homes that emanate grandeur and comfort with the finest facilities, quality construction and customer support that ultimately translates into the possession of their dream home. For sixty years, we have built homes that serve us more than just a place to live – a beautiful haven to store a lifetime’s worth of memories. The legacy of Ajmera is defined by the high quality homes we build, the relationships we maintain, and the integrity with which we do business. We are driven by an unrelenting commitment to craftsmanship and beauty; timelessness and innovation; and excellence in customer service.\nThe progressive approach at Ajmera has enabled us to expand our business interests in multiple areas like cement, vaults security, solar power, sports, social welfare and more. We take immense pride in our customer service which is a reflection of the values that our founders have bestowed on us.\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard - Neighbourhood\n\n![nearby-dummy-map](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/mumbai_staticmap.webp)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n## More Projects in the Malad West Area\n\n![Runwal Auris](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Parikh Perry Apartments](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Auris Serenity](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Sheth Auris Ilaria](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Right Aabiel Avenue](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![PCPL Kaveri](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Aditya Breeze](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Bhoomi Celestia](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Abrol Signature](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Samarth Reva](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/caret-right-bold.svg)","images":[]},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/ajmera-boulevard","title":"Ajmera Boulevard Malad West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","raw_content":"Ajmera Boulevard Malad West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet\n\n[Home](/)\n[Mumbai](/in/mumbai)\n\n>\n\n[Malad West](/in/mumbai/malad-west)\n\nLast updated: Sep 5, 2026\n\n![Project image 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611533541-94822229-1280w.webp)![Project image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611534277-443296187-1280w.webp)![Project image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611534833-192566794-1280w.webp)![Project image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611535531-695320481-1280w.webp)![Project image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611536134-272994611-1280w.webp)![Project image 6](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611536559-480304307-1280w.webp)![Project image 7](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611537246-545264567-1280w.webp)![Project image 8](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611537852-631360449-1280w.webp)![Project image 9](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611538544-368978197-1280w.webp)![Project image 10](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611539257-181876876-1280w.webp)![Project image 11](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611539973-772924269-1280w.webp)![Project image 12](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611540742-566688595-1280w.webp)![Project image 13](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611541396-821411553-1280w.webp)![Project image 14](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611542188-689172620-1280w.webp)![Project image 15](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611542723-282606502-1280w.webp)![Project image 16](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611543673-15171288-1280w.webp)\n\n# Ajmera Boulevard Malad West\n\n[By Ajmera Cityscapes](/builder/ajmera-cityscapes)|\n\nKanchpada, [Malad West](/in/mumbai/malad-west)\n\n₹1.57 Cr - 3.80 Cr All inc.\n\n![Ajmera Boulevard Malad West - main project image](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611533541-94822229-1280w.webp)\n\n![Ajmera Boulevard Malad West - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611534277-443296187-1280w.webp)\n\n![Ajmera Boulevard Malad West - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611534833-192566794-1280w.webp)\n\n![Ajmera Boulevard Malad West - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611535531-695320481-1280w.webp)\n\n![Ajmera Boulevard Malad West - image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788611536134-272994611-1280w.webp)\n\n11+ more\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Ajmera Boulevard\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Malad West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Ajmera Boulevard\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Malad West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.5 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nG+22\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n485-1175 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nP51800054569\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nAdvance Stage (<1 yr)\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2026\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2026\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nYes\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Ajmera Boulevard\n\nAjmera Malad West Project Overview  \nAjmera Boulevard Project will be constructed on 1.5 Acres of land parcel, 1 Tower with G+22 floors having 1 BHK, 2 BHK, Jodi premium residences.  \n  \nAjmera Boulevard Location  \nProject is located Near New Link Rd, Kanchpada, Malad West, Mumbai with -  \nInfiniti Mall - 1.2km  \nMalad Station - 1.8km  \nWestern Express Highway - 2.8km  \n  \nAjmera Boulevard Malad West Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Granite Platform, SS sink, Earthquake Resistance, CP Fittimg, Powder coated aluminium sliding window, CCTV & many more  \n  \nAjmera Cityscapes Malad West External Amenities  \nProject has 30+ amenities with likes of -  \nGymnasium  \nSwimming Pool  \nKid's play area,  \nMultipurpose Hall  \nClubhouse Terrace Truf & Many more  \n  \nAjmera Cityscapes Boulevard Malad West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Tower Parking  \n  \nAjmera Boulevard Possession -  \nRera Possession - December 2026  \nTarget Possession - December 2026  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nAjmera Boulevard Mumbai project has 1BHK, 2BHK, Jodi premium residences with -  \n1BHK - 485 sqft  \n2BHK - 690 sqft  \nJodi - (970 to 1175) sqft  \n  \nAjmera Boulevard floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 4 flats, 2 lifts & 1 staircase on each floor  \n  \nBoulevard Malad West project sample flat is ready to view at the site.  \n  \nAjmera Boulevard Mumbai Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Ajmera Boulevard Malad West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Ajmera Cityscapes Malad West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Location\n\nNr New Link Rd, Kanchpada, Malad West, Mumbai\n\n* Infiniti Mall - 1.2km\n* Malad Station - 1.8km\n* Western Express Highway - 2.8km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Videos\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project is located in a prime area with excellent connectivity to Malad railway station, metro station, Western Express Highway (WEH), and Infiniti Mall.\n\n2.With a 1BHK carpet area of 485 sq. ft., this project offers more space than typical offerings today. Ideal for buyers looking for roomy and comfortable homes.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The apartments do not include balconies. If having a balcony is important to you, this project may not be the right fit.\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![Stainless Steel Sink](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1646987626444-img.webp)\n\nStainless Steel Sink\n\n![CCTV Camera](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/cctv-camera_External_1770712182845-897978997.webp)\n\nCCTV Camera\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Swimming Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447054692-img.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Club House](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/club-house_External_1770724728916-59609935.webp)\n\nClub House\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Jogging Track](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/jogging-track_External_1770724897454-7779386.webp)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![Library](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/library_External_1770724944505-325701878.webp)\n\nLibrary\n\n![Open Gym](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1655644700420-img.webp)\n\nOpen Gym\n\n![Gymnasium](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/gymnasium_External_1770730220696-33756910.webp)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Multi purpose hall](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/multi-purpose-hall_External_1770717854977-274652141.webp)\n\nMulti purpose hall\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Master & Floor Plan\n\n### Master Plan\n\n![Ajmera Boulevard Master Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788612050740-537638212-1280w.webp)\n\n### Floor Plan\n\n![Ajmera Boulevard Floor plan 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788612051182-89433419.webp)![Ajmera Boulevard Floor plan 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788612051628-456805697.webp)![Ajmera Boulevard Floor plan 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-boulevard_1788612052082-412070876.webp)\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n| Carpet Area | All Inc. Price  (Inc. of Taxes & Charges) | Min Downpayment  (Inc. Taxes) | Parking | Unit Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 485 sqftLimited | 1.57 Cr All In | 24.00 Lacs | 1 |\n\nCarpet:485 sqft\n\n![Unit plan - 485 sq.ft.](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/unit_plans/image_0_1788612005901-636523605.webp)\n\n1.57 CrAll Inc. Price(Inc. of Taxes & Charges)\n\n24.00 Lacs\n\nMin Downpayment(Inclusive Taxes)\n\n1Parking\n\nLimited\n\nDown Payment\n\nLoan Amount\n\nInterest\n\nDuration\n\n₹0EMI\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Payment Scheme\n\nRegular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard Litigation Details\n\nIs there any litigation against this proposed project:\n\nYes\n\n| Court Name | City | Case Type | Petition | Case Number | Year | Case Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| SUPREME COURT OF INDIA | Civil | Appeal | 6363 | 2016 | Ongoing |\n| SUPREME COURT OF INDIA | Civil | Appeal | 4988 | 2016 | Ongoing |\n| City Civil Court | Civil | Suit | 2331 | 2004 | Ongoing |\n\n## Documents For Ajmera Boulevard\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Commencement Certificate\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nAjmera Boulevard Commencement Certificate\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Legal Title Report\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nAjmera Boulevard Legal Title Report\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Layout Plan\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nAjmera Boulevard Layout Plan\n\nNote: You can download more detailed documents by following this [link](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/45566)\n\n## Ajmera Boulevard QR Codes\n\n[![RERA QR code - P51800054569](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/RERA-QR-images/rera_qr_code_1744374409063-789843030.webp)\n\nP51800054569](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/45566)\n\n## Project approved by\n\n## About Ajmera Cityscapes\n\nAjmera Cityscapes\n\n![Ajmera Cityscapes](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/Ajmera Cityscapes Logo--1714464410520-img.webp)\n\n1 CityLocations\n\nMumbai suburban\n\n30 yearsExperience\n\n21Total Projects\n\n3K+Happy Families\n\n\"To us Fuller Living is about delivering abundance; about giving you life spaces that allow you to fill your lungs with fresh soothing air; the ability to stretch out your legs and relax; life spaces to bond deeply with your loved ones; life spaces that allow your aspirations to soar untrammelled; life spaces that make for a grand lifestyle; spaces that make for moments that make memories; spaces that allow smiles to blossom and shine. Fuller Living is about rich, enriching life spaces, nurturing supremely happy moments\"\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\nYes, a sample flat is available for viewing. Currently, the 1BHK/2BHK/(1+1)BHK Jodi/(1+2)BHK Jodi show flat is ready and can be visited. Book a free site visit through Housiey and our team will arrange everything.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 December 2026** as per RERA. Construction is currently **100%** complete as of September 5, 2026. Target possession is **01 December 2026**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **P51800054569**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/45566>\n\nYes, litigation details are disclosed as per RERA:  \n• SUPREME COURT OF INDIA - Civil - Ongoing  \n• SUPREME COURT OF INDIA - Civil - Ongoing  \n• City Civil Court - Civil - Ongoing  \n  \nReview all documents carefully before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**, **Proforma Sale Agreement**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **P51800054569**.\n\nThis project offers **12+** amenities. Key external amenities include Multi purpose hall, Gymnasium, Open Gym, Library, and Jogging Track.  \n Internal specifications include CCTV Camera and Stainless Steel Sink. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Ajmera Boulevard, the 1BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **485 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Ajmera Boulevard, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **690 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Ajmera Boulevard, the (1+1)BHK Jodi units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **970 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Ajmera Boulevard, the (1+2)BHK Jodi units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **1175 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 1BHK in Ajmera Boulevard starts from **₹1.57 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **485 sq. ft.** – ₹1.57 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Ajmera Boulevard starts from **₹2.23 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **690 sq. ft.** – ₹2.23 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a (1+1)BHK Jodi in Ajmera Boulevard starts from **₹3.13 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **970 sq. ft.** – ₹3.13 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a (1+2)BHK Jodi in Ajmera Boulevard starts from **₹3.80 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **1175 sq. ft.** – ₹3.80 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **1.5 acres** with **1** towers with **G+22** floors. Each floor has **4** flats per floor, **2** lifts, **1** staircases. It is available in **1BHK/2BHK/(1+1)BHK Jodi/(1+2)BHK Jodi** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **485** to **1175 sq. ft.**\n\nAjmera Boulevard provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Ajmera Boulevard project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **Nr New Link Rd, Kanchpada, Malad West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• Infiniti Mall - 1.2km**   \n**• Malad Station - 1.8km**   \n**• Western Express Highway - 2.8km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹24.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Ajmera Cityscapes**, a trusted real estate brand with over **30 years** of experience and more than **21 completed projects** across **Mumbai suburban**.  \n**Some of their notable developments include:**  \n  \n • **Ajmera Atlantis** in Khar West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Ajmera Downtown** in Marine Lines, Mumbai\n\nThe Commencement Certificate is available. The **Occupancy Certificate (OC)** will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Malad West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Ajmera Cityscapes** - with 30 years of experience - offers 1BHK/2BHK/(1+1)BHK Jodi/(1+2)BHK Jodi at ₹1.57 Cr to ₹3.80 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal  \n(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project  \nAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\n\nThe price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \"Price Sheet\" or \"Brochure\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\n\nHousiey has a **4.8 rating** on Google with **2,395+ reviews**.  \n  \nOver **8,500 families** have purchased homes through Housiey across **8+ cities** with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted **1.2 lakh+ free site visits** and facilitated over **₹8,000 crore** worth of property transactions.\n\n## Explore Related Projects\n\n![Sheth Irene](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/sheth-irene_1773211317528-220150597-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Sheth Irene](/projects/sheth-irene)\n\n₹ 1.45 Cr - 4.50 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Sheth Creators](/builder/sheth-creators)\n\n442- 1355sqft\n\nMalad West\n\nOct 2028\n\n1BHK\n\n442sqft\n\n₹1.45 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n680sqft\n\n₹2.25 Cr\n\n(1+1)BHK Jodi\n\n884sqft\n\n₹2.90 Cr\n\n(1+2)BHK Jodi\n\n1119sqft\n\n₹3.75 Cr\n\n(2+2)BHK Jodi\n\n1355sqft\n\n₹4.50 Cr\n\n[Sheth Creators](/builder/sheth-creators)Developer\n\n![Gurukrupa Marina Enclave](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Marina_Enclave_Elevation--1687947769005-img-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Gurukrupa Marina Enclave](/projects/gurukrupa-marina-enclave)\n\n₹ 1.59 Cr - 2.96 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Gurukrupa Group](/builder/gurukrupa-group)\n\n442- 838sqft\n\nMalad West\n\nReady\n\n1BHK\n\n442sqft\n\n₹1.59 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n618sqft\n\n₹1.94 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n645sqft\n\n₹1.96 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n683sqft\n\n₹2.08 Cr\n\n3BHK\n\n818sqft\n\n₹2.96 Cr\n\n2BHKSold Out\n\n634sqft\n\n-\n\n2BHKSold Out\n\n636sqft\n\n-\n\n2BHKSold Out\n\n638sqft\n\n-\n\n3BHKSold Out\n\n838sqft\n\n-\n\n[Gurukrupa Group](/builder/gurukrupa-group)Developer\n\n![Abrol Signature](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/abrol_signature_elevation