9313055727-img-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Royal Lagoon](/projects/royal-lagoon)\n\n₹ 1.54 Cr - 2.13 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Royal Realtors](/builder/royal-realtors)\n\n591- 702sqft\n\nMalad West\n\nDec 2026\n\n2BHK\n\n₹1.54 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n₹1.60 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n634sqft\n\n₹1.65 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n₹1.73 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n₹1.66 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n₹1.81 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n₹1.81 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n₹1.87 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n₹1.89 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n₹2.13 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n₹1.98 Cr\n\n[Royal Realtors](/builder/royal-realtors)Developer\n\n![Ajmera Arham](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/ajmera-arham_1774350899024-207847224-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Ajmera Arham](/projects/ajmera-arham)\n\n₹ 2.95 Cr - 8.14 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Ajmera Groups](/builder/ajmera-groups)\n\n759- 1928sqft\n\nMalad West\n\nReady\n\n2BHK\n\n₹2.95 Cr\n\n3BHK\n\n₹4.15 Cr\n\n(2+2)BHK Jodi\n\n₹7.07 Cr\n\n(2+3)BHK Jodi\n\n₹8.14 Cr\n\n2BHKLimited\n\n₹3.00 Cr\n\n[Ajmera Groups](/builder/ajmera-groups)Developer\n\n![Legal Illustration](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Fsquare-dots.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![Legal Illustration](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2FlegalSection.webp&w=1024&q=75)\n\nHousiey Legal: Free Real Estate Legal Consultation\n\nGet Expert Advice on RERA, Builder Refunds, Area Mismatch, Stuck Projects & More - at No Cost!\n\n100% Free","images":[]},{"url":"https://nobrokerage.com/project/details/ajmera-boulevard-kanchpada-malad-west-mumbai-524686","title":"Ajmera Boulevard, Malad West, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","raw_content":"![Loading...](/Loader.webp)\n\n* [![Home](/icons/home_quick_link.svg)Home](/)\n* [![Search](/icons/search_quick_link.svg)Search](/search)\n* [![Property](/icons/Add_quick_link.svg)Property](/form/postproperty)\n* [![Profile](/icons/profile_quick_link.svg)Profile](/dashboard)\n\nAjmera Boulevard, Malad West, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com\n\n![Ajmera Boulevard banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765969000835-03289e1e3f40cf21.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/ajmera-boulevard/builderlogos-ajmera-logo-png-51390b.png)\n\nA Malad Masterpiece That Just Belongs To You.\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765969000833-43d1fd10edc63c98.png)\n\n## 1 & 2 BHK Homes\n\nStarting from₹ 1.55 Cr\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Ajmera Boulevard mobile banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765969000824-a9ca3393e16dcb8f.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/ajmera-boulevard/builderlogos-ajmera-logo-png-51390b.png)\n\nA Malad Masterpiece That Just Belongs To You.\n\n![Project details background](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765969000823-f7a0b92b8579bce0.jpg)\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765969000833-43d1fd10edc63c98.png)\n\nOffering\n\n## 1 & 2 BHK Homes\n\nStarting from₹ 1.55 Cr\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nLast Updated : 31 Aug, 2026\n\nAjmera Boulevard\n\nBROKERAGE FREE\n\n[By Ajmera Boulevard Private Limited](/builder/ajmera-cityscapes \"Open Ajmera Boulevard Private Limited page\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 1.55 – 2.20 Cr+ Charges\n\nEMI starts at ₹ 1.35 Lac / M\n\nUnder Construction\n\nCompletion In 31 Dec 2026 Onwards\n\nAjmera Boulevard in Malad West, by the reputable Ajmera Group, offers a refined and tranquil living environment designed for 'Fuller Living.' The project boasts a unique boulevard concept and a separate parking tower, enhancing daily convenience. It provides excellent connectivity, situated just minutes from the Malad Metro Station, Link Road, and major lifestyle hubs like Infiniti Mall and Goregaon Sports Club. This development is an ideal choice for discerning residents seeking a balance of luxury, accessibility, and high-quality residential construction.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\n![Project Type](/projectOverview/icons/project-type.svg)\n\n#### Project Type\n\nResidential\n\n![Status](/projectOverview/icons/status.svg)\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![Project Area](/projectOverview/icons/project-area.svg)\n\n#### Project Area\n\n18051.9 SQM\n\n![Towers](/projectOverview/icons/tower.svg)\n\n#### Towers\n\n1\n\n![Configurations](/projectOverview/icons/configuration.svg)\n\n#### Configurations\n\n1 & 2 BHK Apartments\n\n![Total Floors](/projectOverview/icons/total-units.svg)\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n23\n\n![Amenities](/projectOverview/icons/amenities.svg)\n\n#### Amenities\n\n37 Amenities\n\n![Parking](/projectOverview/icons/parking.svg)\n\n#### Parking\n\nAvailable\n\n![Locality](/projectOverview/icons/locality.svg)\n\n#### Locality\n\nMalad West\n\n![Pin code](/projectOverview/icons/pincode.svg)\n\n#### Pin Code\n\n400064\n\n![Landmark](/projectOverview/icons/landmark.svg)\n\n#### Landmark\n\nMalad Industrial Estates\n\n![Address](/projectOverview/icons/address.svg)\n\n#### Address\n\nAjmera Boulevard, Dhruv Park, Opposite Silver Oaks Banquets, Malad, Kanchpada, Malad West, Malad, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064, India\n\n## Configurations\n\n1 BHK485 sq.ft\n\n₹ 1.55 Crore\n\n2 BHK690 sq.ft\n\n₹ 2.20 Crore\n\n![background pattern](/icons/BgPattern.svg)\n\nMumbai\n\n## Want to Schedule a Site Visit?\n\nExplore the property in person at your convenience.\n\n![schedule illustration](/icons/Illustration.svg)\n\n## FloorPlans\n\n1 BHK₹ 1.55 Cr\n\n485 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![1 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/ajmera-boulevard/ajmera-boulevard-mumbai-1bhk-floor-plan-jpg-2382c7.jpg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2026\n\n### 1 BHK\n\n₹ 1.55 Cr\n\n485sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 1.55 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/ajmera-boulevard/ajmera-boulevard-mumbai-1bhk-floor-plan-jpg-2382c7.jpg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2026\n\n## AboutProject\n\nAjmera Boulevard is thoughtfully positioned in the vibrant heart of Malad West, a location prized for its exceptional urban connectivity and emerging lifestyle. This project is conceptualized as a luxurious retreat, offering residents an elegant \"boulevard\" experience right at their doorstep. The convenience of daily life is a priority, evidenced by the provision of a distinct, separate parking tower, ensuring easy and exclusive access for all homeowners. Strategically, the residence offers superb access to critical city lifelines. Key destinations such as the Malad Metro Station and the New Link Road are just a short 5-minute drive away, while the Western Express Highway is reachable in approximately 10 minutes, making commutes simpler. The area is rich in amenities, with Infiniti and Inorbit Malls, as well as the renowned Goregaon Sports Club, nearby. The development successfully combines tranquil living with absolute metropolitan convenience.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/kids-swimming-pool.svg)\n\nKids Swimming Pool\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/children-play-area-56fac0.png)\n\nChildren's Play Area\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/intercom-2bf28d.png)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/jogging-track-445640.png)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/swimming-pool-79335b.png)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/library.svg)\n\nLibrary\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/30/IMAGE/security-guardspng1-f1b764.png)\n\nSecurity\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/club-house-a73a39.png)\n\nClubhouse\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/indoor-games-5c6e97.png)\n\nIndoor Games Room\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/power-backup.svg)\n\nPower Backup\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24-7-water-supply.svg)\n\n24 7 Water Supply\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24x7-security.svg)\n\n24x7 Security\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/cctv-surveillance.svg)\n\nCctv Surveillance\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/children-play-area.svg)\n\nChildren Play Area\n\n## ProjectGallery\n\n## Brochure\n\n![Brochure Page 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmizpb9ub00xcsahfjthygjdv/v1/page_1_full.webp)\n\n1of28\n\n## AboutLocation\n\nMalad West is a lively and self-sufficient Mumbai suburb known for its busy commercial and shopping scene, including major malls and corporate parks. This dynamic area offers a diverse real estate market, from affordable homes to luxury residences. With plenty of dining and entertainment options, and great connectivity through Link Road and SV Road, it provides a lifestyle of ultimate convenience. An investment here guarantees a complete city experience where work and leisure are perfectly balanced in a thriving, well-connected community.\n\n## Maps\n\nInitializing Map...\n\n![Verified](/icons/green-check.svg)RERA Verified Project\n\n### What is RERA ?\n\nRERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.\n\nIts primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.\n\n![RERA Approved](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/rera.png)\n\n![RERA QR Code](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765969000832-b094f8c1320ad32c.jpg)\n\nRERA ID\n\nP51800054569\n\n## AboutDeveloper\n\n[![Ajmera Cityscapes](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765969052871-f4ffe5a3674dc4fb.jpg)](/builder/ajmera-cityscapes \"Ajmera Cityscapes\")\n\nAjmera Cityscapes![Check](/icons/green-check.svg)\n\nYears of Experience –76 years\n\nThe Ajmera Cityscapes stands as a respected and long-established name in the development sector, with a history spanning over three decades since its founding in the 1950s. Their journey began with a vision to create not just buildings, but complete, enriched living spaces, which they encapsulate in their philosophy of 'Fuller Living.' The company is far more than a real estate entity, operating as a diversified conglomerate with interests extending into hospitality, financial services, and even international pharmaceutical trade. This wide-ranging expertise brings a level of professionalism and stability to their construction projects. Their core mission consistently centers on delivering developments that are built to last and become the preferred choice for those seeking a grand, happy, and fulfilling lifestyle. With a remarkable portfolio boasting the development of over 3 million square feet and the creation of homes for more than 3,000 happy families, the Ajmera Group maintains a strong reputation for excellence and consistent quality in every structure they deliver.\n\n23ProjectsCompleted\n\n4OngoingProjects\n\n1In CityProjects\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nNoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.\n\nThe data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.\n\nNo information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n\nFor feedback or concerns, email: [support@nobrokerage.com](mailto:support@nobrokerage.com)\n\nLoading reviews...\n\n# Frequently Asked\n\nQuestions\n\nGet answers to the most common questions about Ajmera Boulevard in W